<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=5.0">
<title>claude-sonnet-5 — 생각의 입자들</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #0b0d12;
    --fg: #e8ecf4;
    --accent: #d98b5f;
    --accent2: #6fa3b8;
    --dim: #a7afc2;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html, body {
    margin: 0; padding: 0;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--fg);
    font-family: "Pretendard", -apple-system, "Noto Sans KR", sans-serif;
    overflow: hidden;
    height: 100%;
    width: 100%;
  }
  #stage {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }
  canvas {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    touch-action: none;
  }
  /* ---- 오버레이 UI ---- */
  .panel {
    position: fixed;
    left: 50%;
    bottom: 10px;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    z-index: 10;
    max-width: 94vw;
  }
  button, .toggle {
    background: rgba(20, 23, 30, 0.85);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18);
    color: var(--fg);
    font-size: 19px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    cursor: pointer;
    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.1s;
    min-height: 44px;
  }
  button:hover, .toggle:hover { background: rgba(217,139,95,0.25); }
  button:focus-visible, .toggle:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid var(--accent2);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }
  button:active { transform: scale(0.96); }

  header {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    padding: 16px 20px 10px;
    z-index: 10;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(18px, 3.5vw, 24px);
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
  }
  h1 span { color: var(--accent); }
  .sub {
    font-size: clamp(14px, 2.2vw, 16px);
